    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everyone says \"it gets better\" or \"start over\" but they don't get it. you can't restart a life when the foundation is burned to the ground. the person i was is dead. trying to pretend i'm still part of society feels like a joke. it's like i'm just haunting my own life. isn't it just easier to just... stop pretending?",
